<!--meta {"lead": "A gallery shows a braider's portfolio as a grid of square photos with captions, so customers can see real work before they request; in the braider app each photo has a remove action.", "description": "Portfolio grid of captioned photos; read-only on profiles, removable in the braider app.", "pills": ["ul of figures", "Status: stable"], "variants": "read-only (profile), editable (braider app, remove action), art placeholder for a missing photo", "states": "loaded, missing photo, empty (use an empty state), remove action hover and focus", "sources": ["pages/braider-profile/default", "pages/braider-profile-content/default", "pages/braider-profile-content/empty"]} -->
<section class="ds-section" id="overview"><h2><a href="#overview">Overview</a></h2>
  <p>Use a gallery for portfolio work: on the public braider profile ("Recent work") and on the braider's profile content screen, where each item can be removed. It is not a carousel and never auto-plays. When there are no photos, render an <a href="empty-state.html">empty state</a> instead of an empty grid (L2-007).</p>
</section>

<section class="ds-section" id="anatomy"><h2><a href="#anatomy">Anatomy</a></h2>
  <div class="ds-anatomy"><div class="ds-anatomy__figure" style="max-width: 24rem;"><ul class="gallery"><li class="gallery__item"><figure><img class="gallery__photo" src="../../mocks/assets/photos/knotless-braids.png" alt="Medium knotless braids shown from the back, with neat square parts"><figcaption class="gallery__caption">Medium knotless braids · Oct 2026</figcaption></figure></li><li class="gallery__item"><figure><div class="gallery__art" aria-hidden="true">{{icon:sparkle|icon--lg}}</div><figcaption class="gallery__caption">Passion twists · Sep 2026</figcaption></figure></li></ul></div>
    <ol class="ds-anatomy__list">
      <li><div><b>Grid</b><small><code>ul.gallery</code>, auto-fill columns of at least 10rem, <code>--space-3</code> gap.</small></div></li>
      <li><div><b>Photo</b><small>Square, <code>object-fit: cover</code>, <code>--radius-md</code>; descriptive <code>alt</code>.</small></div></li>
      <li><div><b>Caption</b><small>Style · month, caption text.</small></div></li>
      <li><div><b>Actions</b><small>Braider app only: a small ghost "Remove" button named with the caption.</small></div></li>
    </ol></div>
</section>

<section class="ds-section" id="variants"><h2><a href="#variants">Variants</a></h2>
  {{example:[stack]Read-only on the profile; editable in the braider app.}}
<ul class="gallery"><li class="gallery__item"><figure><img class="gallery__photo" src="../../mocks/assets/photos/knotless-braids.png" alt="Medium knotless braids shown from the back"><figcaption class="gallery__caption">Medium knotless braids · Oct 2026</figcaption></figure></li><li class="gallery__item"><figure><img class="gallery__photo" src="../../mocks/assets/photos/nia.jpg" alt="Nia Okafor smiling in her studio"><figcaption class="gallery__caption">Nia at the studio · Sep 2026</figcaption></figure></li></ul>
<ul class="gallery"><li class="gallery__item"><figure><img class="gallery__photo" src="../../mocks/assets/photos/knotless-braids.png" alt="Medium knotless braids shown from the back"><figcaption class="gallery__caption">Medium knotless braids · Oct 2026</figcaption></figure><div class="gallery__actions"><button class="btn btn--sm btn--ghost" type="button">{{icon:trash}}Remove<span class="visually-hidden"> Medium knotless braids · Oct 2026</span></button></div></li></ul>
  {{/example}}
</section>

<section class="ds-section" id="sizes" data-na="Items size to the grid; there is one item size."><h2><a href="#sizes">Sizes</a></h2></section>

<section class="ds-section" id="states"><h2><a href="#states">States</a></h2>
  <ul><li><b>Loaded</b>: the photo fills its square.</li><li><b>Missing photo</b>: the accent art panel with the sparkle icon keeps the grid even.</li><li><b>Empty</b>: replaced by an empty state with "Add photo" in the braider app.</li><li><b>Remove</b>: button hover, focus and busy follow the button states.</li></ul>
  {{themes}}<ul class="gallery"><li class="gallery__item"><figure><div class="gallery__art" aria-hidden="true">{{icon:sparkle|icon--lg}}</div><figcaption class="gallery__caption">Passion twists · Sep 2026</figcaption></figure></li></ul>{{/themes}}
</section>

<section class="ds-section" id="responsive"><h2><a href="#responsive">Responsive behaviour</a></h2>
  <ul><li>Two columns at 360px, three or four in a profile card on desktop; the minimum column is 10rem (or the full width when narrower).</li><li>Captions wrap; nothing scrolls horizontally.</li></ul>
</section>

<section class="ds-section" id="theming"><h2><a href="#theming">Theming</a></h2>
  <p>The art panel uses <code>--color-accent-subtle</code> and <code>--color-fg-accent</code>, the same pairing as story-card art, so both themes read alike.</p>
</section>

<section class="ds-section" id="accessibility"><h2><a href="#accessibility">Accessibility</a></h2>
  <h3>Role and pattern</h3><p>A list of figures: screen readers announce "list, 3 items" and each photo's alt text with its caption.</p>
  <h3>Keyboard</h3><table class="ds-table ds-keys"><thead><tr><th scope="col">Key</th><th scope="col">Action</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><kbd>Tab</kbd></td><td>Read-only: skipped. Editable: moves through the Remove buttons in order.</td></tr></tbody></table>
  <h3>Focus</h3><p>The shared ring on Remove; after removal, focus moves to the next item's Remove button, or to "Add photo" when the list is empty.</p>
  <h3>Labelling</h3><p>Alt text describes the work ("Medium knotless braids shown from the back"); the art placeholder is decorative. Remove buttons include the caption.</p>
  <h3>Contrast</h3>
  <div class="ds-example__canvas ds-example__canvas--stack" style="padding: 0; gap: var(--space-2);">
    {{pair:Caption|--color-fg-muted|--color-bg-surface|4.5}}
    {{pair:Art icon|--color-fg-accent|--color-accent-subtle|3}}
  </div>
  <h3>Motion</h3><p>None.</p>
  <h3>Touch</h3><p>Remove buttons are small buttons with a 44px target.</p>
</section>

<section class="ds-section" id="content"><h2><a href="#content">Content</a></h2>
  <ul><li>Caption: style · month and year ("Medium knotless braids · Oct 2026"), at most 120 characters.</li><li>Alt text says what the hair looks like, not "photo of".</li></ul>
</section>

<section class="ds-section" id="do-dont"><h2><a href="#do-dont">Do and don't</a></h2>
  <div class="ds-dodont">
    <figure class="ds-do"><div class="ds-example__canvas"><p class="text-muted">Nia hasn’t added portfolio work yet.</p></div><figcaption>No photos: an honest empty state.</figcaption></figure>
    <figure class="ds-dont"><div class="ds-example__canvas"><ul class="gallery"><li class="gallery__item"><figure><div class="gallery__art" aria-hidden="true">{{icon:sparkle|icon--lg}}</div><figcaption class="gallery__caption">Sample work</figcaption></figure></li></ul></div><figcaption>Placeholder "sample" items imply work that does not exist.</figcaption></figure>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="ds-section" id="tokens"><h2><a href="#tokens">Tokens</a></h2>
  <div class="ds-table-wrap"><table class="ds-table"><thead><tr><th scope="col">Part</th><th scope="col">Token</th><th scope="col">Light</th><th scope="col">Dark</th></tr></thead><tbody>
    {{tok:Gap|--space-3}}
    {{tok:Photo shape|--radius-md}}
    {{tok:Art background / icon|--color-accent-subtle|--color-fg-accent}}
    {{tok:Caption|--color-fg-muted}}
  </tbody></table></div>
</section>

<section class="ds-section" id="code"><h2><a href="#code">Code</a></h2>
  <pre><code>&lt;ul class="gallery"&gt;
  &lt;li class="gallery__item"&gt;
    &lt;figure&gt;&lt;img class="gallery__photo" src="…" alt="Medium knotless braids shown from the back"&gt;
      &lt;figcaption class="gallery__caption"&gt;Medium knotless braids · Oct 2026&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;
    &lt;div class="gallery__actions"&gt;&lt;button class="btn btn--sm btn--ghost" type="button"&gt;Remove…&lt;/button&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
  &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</code></pre>
</section>

<section class="ds-section" id="sources"><h2><a href="#sources">Sources</a></h2>
